    activates a monster effect (Quick Effect): You can banish 1 card from your hand
    or field, then target 1 monster on the field; banish it. If this card in its
    owner''s possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card: You can target 1 of
    your banished "Myutant" Spells; add it to your hand.'
